A training course usually covers all the issues discussed here in much greater detail and often includes practical experience as well.
A training course usually lasts from 2 to 5 days and includes role-playing and a high volume of first aid training, sometimes also covering weapon usage.
There are many books and magazines dealing with surviving in the wild, but publications focusing on war zones are few and far between.
